; Directives around rules. The rules read their amounts as hledger reads any amount (the same
; decimal mark and digit groups), and change nothing for the transactions around them.
Y 2026
decimal-mark ,
commodity 1.000,00 EUR
D 1.000,00 EUR
alias old=new
apply account top

= x
    (budget)  1.000,5
    (budget)  1,5 EUR
    a  *1,5

~ monthly
    (budget)  1.000,5
    old  1,5 EUR

end apply account
decimal-mark .

= x
    (budget)  1,000.5

2026-01-01 t
    old:a  1.000,50 EUR
    b  5
    c  -1.005,50
